                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Rural health care and conservation are both essential for the Big First\u2019s way of life. I stopped by Rice County District Hospital and met with the Rice County Conservation District in Lyons to discuss improving access to care and preserving the land we rely on. Thanks for meeting with me!",
