                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "The One Big Beautiful Bill invests in the future of agriculture by lowering taxes for producers and strengthening the farm safety net.\n\nWe still must pass a comprehensive, five-year Farm Bill that provides certainty for our producers, further invests in animal health research, and addresses the issues of today, not 2018.",
