                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "Access to quality health care is vital to our rural communities. I visited SunPorch in Smith Center\u2014where I met Blondina Kuhlmann, who just celebrated her 100th birthday\u2014and toured Graham County Hospital in Hill City to learn more about how providers are caring for Kansans across the Big First. Thank you for the meetings!",
