                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The week is off to a busy start here in Washington, DC. Yesterday, I introduced three rural health care bills that will modernize our Rural Health Clinics and ensure every American has equal access to quality care, no matter their zip code.\n\nI also spoke on the House floor today to highlight the storied tradition of the Kansas State Fair. For more than a century, families have made the trip to Hutchinson every September to celebrate agriculture, spend time together, and showcase the very best of our state. While I\u2019m sad I couldn\u2019t stay longer, I\u2019m looking forward to another week of supporting Kansas ag by fighting for conservative, commonsense policies in our nation\u2019s capital.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
                "text_tags": null,
                "timestamp": 1757431450,
