                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I sat down with the Greater Topeka Chamber of Commerce in Washington this week to discuss the gems of the animal health corridor, workforce development, and growing the aviation industry in northeast Kansas. From the opening of Link Innovation Labs to the 190th Air Refueling Wing, Topeka is leading the way in high-impact sectors that matter to our national security and state economy. Thanks for the meeting!",
                "text_lang": "en",
