                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "No American should have to sacrifice access to quality health care because of their zip code.\n\nAs the representative of 60 primarily rural counties across the state of Kansas, I understand the unique challenge rural America faces in accessing quality health care. That\u2019s why I introduced three pieces of legislation that remove these regulatory barriers and make necessary modernizations that bring rural health care to the 21st century. Health care cannot be a one-size-fits-all policy. \n\nThese commonsense reforms better equip health care facilities and professionals to effectively meet the needs of the communities they serve.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
                "text_tags": null,
                "timestamp": 1758038256,
                "view_count": 214
            },
