                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 5,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "If Washington Democrats succeed in shutting down the government, our service members don\u2019t get paid, our veterans will receive delayed health care, and vulnerable moms won\u2019t get WIC.\n\nWe should keep the government open, not force taxpayers to fund health care for illegal immigrants.",
