                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 2,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Washington Democrats are playing political theater and forcing this government shutdown. As a result, our service members aren't getting paid, our veterans are receiving delayed health care, and vulnerable moms risk having their benefits delayed.\n\nIt\u2019s time for Senate Democrats to support our non-partisan government funding bill and put America first.",
