                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 5,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Washington Democrats have shut down the federal government for a week because they want hardworking Americans to pay for free health care for illegal immigrants.\n\nIt\u2019s time to come to the table, re-open the government, and get our fiscal house in order.",
