                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 8,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "10 days ago, Washington Democrats chose to shut down the federal government.\n\n@HouseGOP did our job and passed a non-partisan CR that extends the government for seven weeks. Instead of doing their job and keeping the government open, Senate Democrats are fighting for free health care for illegal immigrants and continually vote against the well-being of Americans.\n\nThis is not what Kansans voted for.",
