                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "This government shutdown is the direct result of Washington Democrats prioritizing far-left policies over fiscal responsibility.\n\nHouse Republicans voted to keep the lights on, but Democrats refuse to reopen the government unless taxpayers fund free health care for illegal immigrants.",
