                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Three weeks in, Washington Democrats are still playing politics with Americans\u2019 livelihoods.\n\n@HouseGOP passed a clean, non-partisan CR to keep the government open 36 days ago, but Washington Democrats would rather fight for free health care for illegal immigrants than keep basic services functioning for American citizens.",
